# Reserva Salvaje, area 1 (C5b, contract 48), 28 x 22. column = i, row = j. The gate house arrives at the SOUTH edge (spawn `gate` (13,19)); leaving is the step triggers (12..14,21): the question "end the visit?"
# (`reserva_end` + the warp back to the gate house); the NORTH edge (13..14,0) leads to area 2. Look (the user's mock "Reserva Salvaje"): a SAVANNA: pale ground (`sav`, 3 variants), patches of TALL DRY GRASS (the wild
# grass), ACACIAS, a pond, a low wooden fence round the area. Wild grass (rate 30, Reserve rate): the common ones and the rare Lambalm; the pond has a surf table and the three rods' tables (the alloy rod: Reefling).
@map reserva_1
@size 28 22
@interior no
@area reserva
@bg 0
@fill sav
@spawn gate 13 19 N
@spawn north 13 1 S
@encounters grass rate=30
  shellfern 22 25 10               # C9 (contract 56): weight lowered to make room for the fill-in (the table still adds up to 100)
  quillix 22 25 10               # C9 (contract 56): weight lowered to make room for the fill-in (the table still adds up to 100)
  mossbud 22 25 15
  jabbird 23 26 10
  quillara 22 25 10               # contract 58: the pair of the Quillix line
  wombamma 25 28 10
  gnucharge 24 27 10
  lambalm 22 24 5
  dashkip 22 25 10               # C9 (contract 56): the fill-in of the design notes
  pinecub 22 25 10               # C9 (contract 56): the fill-in of the design notes
@end
# Open ground (contract 63, wild zone): a step onto plain ground (not tall grass, water, a door, a ledge, an arrow floor) rolls this table when rand8 < 8 (8/256 per step).
@open_rate 8
# Roaming wild creatures (contract 55, rollout in 63): 3 creatures of this table wander the open ground (not the tall grass); touching one starts that wild battle.
@roam 3 table=grass period=1800
@encounters water rate=15
  skipgoby 22 26 50
  flopfin 20 24 30
  lazatee 24 27 20
@end
@encounters fish_old
  flopfin 5 5 100
@end
@encounters fish_good rate=128
  flopfin 10 10 25
  skipgoby 10 10 30
  lazatee 10 10 25
  clubrimp 10 10 20
@end
@encounters fish_super
  lazatee 15 20 30
  skipgoby 15 20 30
  clubrimp 15 20 15
  reefling 15 18 10
  flopfin 15 20 15
@end
@legend
  .  tile=sav
  g  tile=dgrass
  a  tile=sav object=acacia_0
  b  tile=sav object=acacia_1
  f  tile=sav object=rfence_i
  F  tile=sav object=rfence_j
  W  tile=canal_o
  T  tile=canal_tr
  r  tile=sav object=rock
  y  tile=sav object=dry_bush
  n  tile=sav
  x  tile=sav interact=step script=leave
  s  tile=sav object=sign text=rv.sign1 interact=look
  i  item=rich_salve
  j  item=antidote
@grid
  fffffffffffffnnfffffffffffff
  F....................y....rF
  F......a...................F
  F..........a.......TTTTTT..F
  F..gggggg..........WWWWWW..F
  F..gggggg..........WWWWWW..F
  F..gggggg......b...WWWWWW..F
  F..gggggg..........WWWWWW..F
  F..gggggg..................F
  F.b.....................b..F
  F.........gggg......a......F
  F....a....gggg.............F
  F.......y.gggg...ggggggg...F
  F..gggg..........ggggggg...F
  F..gggg.....b....ggggggg.a.F
  F..gggg........r.ggggggg...F
  F..gggg..........ggggggg...F
  F...i....a....s............F
  F.....y...........b...aj...F
  F...b...........a..........F
  Fr.........................F
  ffffffffffffxxxfffffffffffff
@warp n -> reserva_2 spawn=south
# The way out: stepping onto the south edge asks to end the visit: YES ends the session (the crystals are taken back, the fee is not refunded) and returns him to the gate house; NO turns him back.
@script leave step
    ask puerta.leave
    jv 0 1 bye
    hero_walk NE 1
    end
  bye:
    reserva_end 4
    say puerta.bye
    warp puerta_reserva spawn=from_reserva
@end
